#!/bin/bash
# Regret study, binary rewards: d = 16, 10 cases
# (r = 1, 2, 4 at K = 16 and r = 2 at K = 32, 64; two designs) x 50 replications x 21 arms
# = 10,500 cells, about 10 per array task.
# Submit:  JOBID=$(qsub -terse submit_binomial.sge | cut -d. -f1); qsub -hold_jid $JOBID notify.sge
# Resubmitting finishes an interrupted run (a finished cell is skipped).  Then: python3 collect_regret.py binomial
#$ -pe smp 1
#$ -q long
#$ -N regret_binomial
#$ -t 1-1100
#$ -tc 110
#$ -r n

module load python/3.12.15
cd $SGE_O_WORKDIR
python3 run_regret.py binomial --chunk $SGE_TASK_ID --chunks 1100
